1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC, "Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,639
You scared the life out of me!

4
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,439
Look, if you're sleepy,

5
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:01,719
why don't you just go upstairs and get some sleep?

6
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:03,160
I wasn't sleeping.

7
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,239
I was meditating.

8
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,280
Meditating, my foot.

9
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:08,600
Where's Ming Yu?

10
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,319
Hasn't he been back at all lately?

11
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,360
He hasn't been home since he got back from Ma'ao.

12
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,200
Don't pretend you don't know.

13
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,600
Come on.

14
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:21,200
Didn't you and Mr. Zheng...

15
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:22,920
conspire to do this?

16
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,320
Conspire?

17
00:02:24,321 --> 00:02:26,400
Wait, what did we conspire about?

18
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,520
Keep acting.
Keep it up.

19
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,920
You...

20
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:37,880
The two of you...

21
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,279
had Ming Yu accompany...

22
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:42,200
Mr. Zheng's daughter to Ma'ao.

23
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,400
Wasn't that to try and set them up?

24
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,880
Did you think I wouldn't see through...

25
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,120
your little scheme?

26
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,039
Mr. Zheng had that intention,

27
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,520
and I couldn't just brush him off.

28
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,840
Right? The main thing is An An.

29
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:55,520
We watched her grow up.

30
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,880
We know her family well.

31
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,840
It's exactly because I know them well...

32
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:01,160
that I don't want any connection with that family.

33
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,880
I'm telling you,

34
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,680
it's the young people's business.

35
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,160
Let them decide for themselves.

36
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,400
Maybe this time in Ma'ao,

37
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:11,160
some sparks will fly between them.

38
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,840
I don't want to hear that.

39
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:16,080
I can't believe you would do that.

40
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,800
Ming Yu was clearly going there for work.

41
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,120
It was a business trip.

42
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,776
Yet, you had to go and trouble him.

43
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,760
You really don't know when to stay out of things.

44
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,000
You...

45
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:28,600
You just don't like An An's mother, do you?

46
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,000
She's the stepmother.

47
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,600
She's just a future in-law.

48
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:40,079
At most, we'll just see less of them.

49
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,120
Wouldn't that be fine?

50
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,600
In-law?

51
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:50,520
Surprise!

52
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,000
You look so handsome!

53
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,480
Ming Yu.

54
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,680
Tell me, isn't she exhausted?

55
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,040
Hurry up.

56
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,080
Smile for the camera. Come on.

57
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,680
The baby is 100 days old! This is fun.

58
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:13,760
Oh, my goodness.

59
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:16,799
What did I do to deserve this?

60
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,520
To become in-laws with Dong Xian?

61
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,840
If the heavens could arrange for the right woman...

62
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,400
to capture Ming Yu's heart,

63
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:25,360
I would even go vegetarian for a year!

64
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,440
(Episode 12: As Lousy As a QR Code)

65
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:38,640
She's really not home.

66
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,079
It's better that she's not.

67
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,760
If she were, the surprise would be ruined.

68
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:44,440
- Let's go. - Let's go.

69
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,440
Is it ready? I'm starving.

70
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,440
It's ready. All done.

71
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,360
Come eat.

72
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,159
(Happy Birthday)

73
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,559
Nice skills.

74
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,640
You even carved the carrot.

75
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,160
But you made so much. I might not be able to finish it.

76
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:14,240
You have to finish it.

77
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,240
Or I'll deduct your year-end bonus.

78
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,279
What are you wiping off?

79
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,280
My lipstick.

80
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,320
I don't want to eat it with my meal.

81
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,240
No need to wipe it off. It looks good.

82
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,480
What's with you today?

83
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,480
Did you take a crash course in EQ?

84
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,120
Just eat.

85
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,800
Thank you.

86
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,280
There's cake too?

87
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,920
Looks like you were prepared.

88
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,040
"Dear 'Captain' Ruan,"

89
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:05,159
"if the road ahead is long,"

90
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,920
"I hope it's paved with flowers."

91
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:09,400
"If not, you don't have to be afraid,"

92
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,480
"because we will always be by your side."

93
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:15,120
"Be a proud princess."

94
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:19,480
"Love you forever."

95
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,320
Actually,

96
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,479
I ordered this cake for you...

97
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,680
on behalf of Hengshi.

98
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,759
The message on it represents the blessings and affection...

99
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:34,000
from all the employees...

100
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,720
at Hengshi.

101
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,560
Happy birthday.

102
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:41,920
Thank you.

103
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,560
Not bad!

104
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,560
- You're really amazing. - Of course.

105
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,256
"Captain" Ruan, I can see that...

106
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,960
you don't want your year-end bonus docked.

107
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,080
Who would want that?

108
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,040
(Dong Xian)

109
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:39,840
Hello?

110
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,000
No need.

111
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:47,280
I've finished eating. How did you know I live here?

112
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,160
It's still raining outside.

113
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,720
You should head back soon.

114
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,040
Okay.

115
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,600
Wait a moment.

116
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,320
Boss, do you have an umbrella?

117
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:07,760
Yes.

118
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,600
What do you need it for?

119
00:08:09,601 --> 00:08:11,241
I want to go downstairs to get something.

120
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:13,960
It's pouring outside.

121
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,160
I'll go.

122
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,160
Thank you, boss.

123
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,840
Ms. Dong.

124
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,320
Sorry to keep you waiting.

125
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:42,960
Ming Yu?

126
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,880
Where's Ruan Ruan?

127
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,200
The rain is too heavy, so I didn't let her come down.

128
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:53,640
Ming Yu,

129
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,520
may I ask you something?

130
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,080
What is your current relationship with Ruan Ruan?

131
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,720
During work hours,

132
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,880
it's an employer-employee relationship.

133
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,560
After work,

134
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,000
we're friends.

135
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:11,840
Still just friends?

136
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,840
Ms. Dong,

137
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,800
what kind of relationship we end up having...

138
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,960
depends on how Si Xian defines it.

139
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,320
When I go upstairs later,
I can ask her.

140
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,600
All right, then...

141
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,240
I'll leave it to you.

142
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,040
I'll be sure to pass on your wishes.

143
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:33,560
It's raining hard.
Please get home safely.

144
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,960
Thank you, Ming Yu.

145
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,080
You're back.

146
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:04,040
Ms. Dong actually asked me a few days ago...

147
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:06,120
if you were scheduled for a shift today.

148
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,080
- Did you tell her? - No.

149
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,160
I have professional integrity, okay?

150
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:22,640
It's the same one you ordered.

151
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,480
"Don't mention..."

152
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:29,680
"Dad"?

153
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,040
She's my mom.

154
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,480
She just asked me...

155
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,040
what our relationship is.

156
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,720
And what did you say?

157
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,560
I told her...

158
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:56,760
that we're friends.

159
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,960
Yes, exactly.

160
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:01,640
We're friends.

161
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,600
Since we're friends,

162
00:11:11,040 --> 00:11:12,040
come.

163
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,800
I have a birthday present for you.

164
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,480
You'll accept it, right?

165
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,560
What is it?

166
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,320
After you.

167
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,000
So many planes.

168
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:45,280
Do you like them?

169
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,400
I thought you were giving me a real airplane.

170
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,720
That's not impossible.

171
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,960
But there's a condition.

172
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,120
Are these all from your collection?

173
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:01,920
Yes.

174
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:04,040
Are you really giving them to me?

175
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:06,400
- Take your pick. - Then I won't be modest.

176
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:11,080
I'll pick...

177
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,440
The Z101.

178
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,800
I never said you could only pick one.

179
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,600
Really?

180
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,880
Anything you like in this room,

181
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,280
you can have it.

182
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:24,600
What if I like everything?

183
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:26,160
Does that include me?

184
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:30,680
Fu Ming Yu,

185
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:33,480
are you trying to take advantage of me?

186
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,080
You want to hit me again?

187
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,040
Or kick me this time?

188
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,200
Today,

189
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:53,920
you look really beautiful.

190
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:19,760
Well...

191
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:21,080
I'll head back now.

192
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:46,440
- Surprise! Happy birthday! - Surprise! Happy birthday!

193
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,840
You guys scared me to death!

194
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:53,560
Your cake.

195
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,200
I don't want it anymore. Keep it for yourself.

196
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,040
I've left it by the door.

197
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,400
Remember to take it inside.

198
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,800
Spill it.

199
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,360
We waited forever for you to come back.

200
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:10,520
Where have you been?

201
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,880
What were you doing with Fu Ming Yu?

202
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,320
Confess everything.

203
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:16,680
I...

204
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:22,960
Speak up.

205
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,040
What did you eat tonight?

206
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:27,520
- Longevity noodles. - Just longevity noodles?

207
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,160
He's a big-shot VP,

208
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,536
and he only ordered longevity noodles?

209
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,600
It wasn't takeout.

210
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:33,440
He cooked them for me.

211
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:34,520
What?

212
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,400
A big-shot VP like him...

213
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,399
personally cooked longevity noodles for you?

214
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:39,400
All right.

215
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:41,280
Can we stop focusing on the food?

216
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,680
Then you ask her.

217
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,200
I'll do it.

218
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,320
What exactly did you two do tonight?

219
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:49,920
He cooked noodles,

220
00:14:49,921 --> 00:14:51,559
I ate them, picked a gift,

221
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:52,639
and then I came back.

222
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:53,759
- That's it? - That's all.

223
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:54,839
- Then why were you panicking? - Was I panicking?

224
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:56,039
You were panicking.

225
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,359
When you came in and closed the door,

226
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:59,641
you were breathing so heavily, and your face was all red.

227
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,240
I swear,

228
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:05,159
that's because I ran down the stairs.

229
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,240
I didn't take the elevator.

230
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,119
With your stamina,

231
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,600
would you pant after just one floor?

232
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:12,160
And he even ordered a cake for you.

233
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:14,119
One was from my mom.

234
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,120
The other was from him,

235
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:16,520
on behalf of the company.

236
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,599
I've been at Hengshi for seven years,

237
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,520
and I've never seen such special treatment.

238
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,080
You poor thing.

239
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,480
- Open it and see. - Open it and see.

240
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,240
It's smashed.

241
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,656
It has been through some rough times.

242
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:32,680
But it's still edible.

243
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:37,120
You didn't have a single bite?

244
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:40,080
I didn't have time to eat it before I came back.

245
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,280
Why did you come back so early?

246
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,520
Was it because he had some ulterior motives?

247
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:48,160
No, it's because...

248
00:15:49,040 --> 00:15:51,119
I wanted to bring the model plane home quickly.

249
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,640
I was afraid he would change his mind.

250
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:53,760
I believe you, I really do.

251
00:15:53,761 --> 00:15:55,800
"If it's a long road ahead..."

252
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:57,800
Aren't those my lines?

253
00:15:58,640 --> 00:15:59,640
They really are.

254
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,680
She's got such a strong poker face.

255
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:16,560
We've been asking all night, but we got nothing out of her.

256
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,760
I don't think you need to ask.

257
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:20,840
There's definitely something between them.

258
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:22,800
But you can rest easy.

259
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,120
Your job is safe for sure.

260
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:25,360
Right?

261
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:28,640
Go park the car yourself.

262
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:30,639
I can't even tell whose car this is anymore.

263
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,840
I'm the one driving every day.

264
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:35,920
Drive safely!

265
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,320
Today is Ruan Ruan's birthday.

266
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,160
Xuan and I found out...

267
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,880
that there's something going on...

268
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,440
between her and our vice president.

269
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,256
We grilled her all night, but she didn't crack.

270
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:58,280
She's so tight-lipped.

271
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,640
You're pretty tight-lipped too.

272
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,040
You still haven't confessed your feelings.

273
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:02,480
How much longer do you plan...

274
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,000
to sleep here?

275
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:43,520
It must be my period.

276
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:45,600
It's the hormones.

277
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,960
Otherwise, why would I think about him?

278
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,000
Stop thinking about him.

279
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:54,760
Once my period starts,

280
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:56,480
I must lock my heart away.

281
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:59,920
Stop thinking about him.

282
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:11,960
No way.

283
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,720
Are these hormones that powerful?

284
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:19,720
Have you had breakfast?

285
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,440
Yes.

286
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,680
It's raining a bit today.

287
00:19:23,800 --> 00:19:25,040
It might be hard to get a taxi.

288
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:26,120
Go change your clothes first.

289
00:19:26,121 --> 00:19:27,281
I'll wait for you downstairs.

290
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:47,480
Mr. Fu,

291
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:48,840
today's flight might not...

292
00:20:49,120 --> 00:20:50,280
be able to take off smoothly.

293
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,520
Should I notify them first?

294
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:53,960
Okay.

295
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:00,040
I'm going to the US today.

296
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,600
I'll be back in 10 days.

297
00:21:05,280 --> 00:21:06,280
So?

298
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:09,840
I'm just letting you know.

299
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:12,760
Why bother telling me?

300
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:28,200
Get out. I'll park the car.

301
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:30,560
It's raining outside.

302
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:33,040
If you stop here, I'll have to walk in the rain.

303
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:35,560
If I go to that parking lot,

304
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,176
you'll have to walk even further.

305
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:38,200
Isn't this closer?

306
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:40,600
Then can't you drop me off at the entrance?

307
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:42,680
- Where? - The main entrance.

308
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:47,120
Only the executives can park their cars there, right?

309
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:49,279
If we stop the car there...

310
00:21:49,280 --> 00:21:51,376
and other colleagues see us, what are we going to do?

311
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:53,240
Anyway, it's raining. I'm not going out there.

312
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:56,080
You make it sound so bad.

313
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:58,479
If I called a ride-hail car, wouldn't they stop at the door?

314
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,560
Am I a ride-hail driver?

315
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:02,456
If I drive over there, colleagues will recognize my car.

316
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,840
You're just afraid of being seen.

317
00:22:04,680 --> 00:22:06,759
That's not what I'm thinking at all.

318
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:08,400
That's exactly what you mean.

319
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:10,120
If people see us and ask,

320
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:12,480
I'll say I ran into you in the rain,

321
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,440
and you just happened to give me a lift.

322
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,480
Besides, who would even ask me that?

323
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:19,680
Are you new to the workplace?

324
00:22:20,720 --> 00:22:22,239
A lot of people are very nosy.

325
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,479
They'll definitely ask.

326
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:25,199
When that happens, I'll have to waste time explaining.

327
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,200
You don't want to explain,

328
00:22:26,201 --> 00:22:27,761
so you would rather I walk in the rain.

329
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:30,720
There's an umbrella.

330
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:38,000
Yue Yang,

331
00:22:38,120 --> 00:22:39,639
if any other colleague...

332
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:41,359
who had no relationship with you...

333
00:22:41,360 --> 00:22:42,360
was in your car today,

334
00:22:42,361 --> 00:22:43,839
they wouldn't be treated like this.

335
00:22:43,840 --> 00:22:45,920
Let me tell you, there is no "any other colleague".

336
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:47,919
You're the only one who has ever sat in this seat.

337
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:48,920
You're the only woman who has sat here.

338
00:22:48,921 --> 00:22:50,121
I don't even let men sit here.

339
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:52,960
- Really? - Really. It's true.

340
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:55,480
I'm telling you, when you're not around,

341
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:57,159
I keep a photo here...

342
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:58,656
and put a pile of snacks on this side.

343
00:22:58,680 --> 00:23:00,319
I have to remind them that this seat is taken.

344
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:01,840
Her name is Jiang Zi Yue. Okay?

345
00:23:03,360 --> 00:23:04,360
Then swear it.

346
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:09,000
Swear it.

347
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:12,360
Actually, in your current state,

348
00:23:12,361 --> 00:23:13,481
I know what you're thinking.

349
00:23:13,840 --> 00:23:15,520
You want people to know...

350
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,240
that we're in love, right?

351
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,160
I think this kind of happiness...

352
00:23:19,161 --> 00:23:21,161
is enough as long as the two of us know it, right?

353
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:22,720
Why do we...

354
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,839
have to make it formal and show others?

355
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:26,079
What is there to prove?

356
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:28,120
Besides, you're so pretty and capable.

357
00:23:28,600 --> 00:23:30,719
Your colleagues aren't even in your league.

358
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,119
If they get jealous of you,

359
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:33,680
I can't even imagine what would happen.

360
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,400
That's enough from you.

361
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,360
You're all talk.

362
00:23:43,040 --> 00:23:44,120
Yes, I'm all talk.

363
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:47,320
You only do this when I'm angry.

364
00:23:48,600 --> 00:23:49,960
All right, don't be angry anymore.

365
00:23:50,600 --> 00:23:51,600
You'll be late.

366
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:54,800
Go on.

367
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:00,960
I'm really leaving.
Go on.

368
00:25:25,600 --> 00:25:26,600
Thank you.

369
00:25:46,040 --> 00:25:47,656
What are you looking at? Checking for drunk driving?

370
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:48,680
Morning, Ms. Jiang.

371
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:50,240
I just saw it.

372
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:52,520
Ruan Si Xian got out of Mr. Fu's car.

373
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:54,679
- Really? - It's true.

374
00:25:54,680 --> 00:25:56,120
Mr. Fu's car was parked right there.

375
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:57,880
Mr. Fu dropped her off personally.

376
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:07,080
Ms. Jiang, let me tell you.

377
00:26:07,560 --> 00:26:09,320
I was giving her lessons before,

378
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:10,800
teaching her how to woo Mr. Fu.

379
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:12,320
This is so hilarious.

380
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,880
Thinking back, I really was a clown.

381
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,440
What time is your flight?

382
00:26:19,520 --> 00:26:20,520
Don't be late.

383
00:26:21,640 --> 00:26:23,016
Ms. Jiang, I'm running out of time.

384
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:24,320
I have to go now. See you later.

385
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:52,000
(Lu Ming)

386
00:27:17,760 --> 00:27:18,760
Xiao... Xiao Zhen.

387
00:27:19,360 --> 00:27:20,920
Ma'am, let me explain.

388
00:27:34,520 --> 00:27:35,520
Lu Ming?

389
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:00,440
Yes, that's the one.

390
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:11,960
Ni Tong, we're leaving.

391
00:28:12,040 --> 00:28:13,640
Bye. Be safe.

392
00:28:18,080 --> 00:28:19,960
When will this rain stop?

393
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:23,600
The waitlist is so long. How long will it take?

394
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:28,640
Ni Tong.

395
00:28:29,280 --> 00:28:31,000
- Ms. Ruan. - Have you secured a ride?

396
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:32,920
Not yet.

397
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:34,896
There are still more than 20 people ahead of me.

398
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:35,920
Where are you headed?

399
00:28:35,960 --> 00:28:37,279
A friend of mine is coming to pick me up.

400
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:38,280
We'll give you a ride.

401
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:40,640
Ms. Ruan,

402
00:28:40,960 --> 00:28:43,360
this friend of yours wouldn't happen to be Mr. Fu, would it?

403
00:28:44,560 --> 00:28:45,720
Just wait for your ride-hail.

404
00:28:46,800 --> 00:28:48,200
Can't I even ask?

405
00:28:49,520 --> 00:28:50,840
Xiao Zhen, where are you?

406
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:53,000
I'm already in the parking lot.

407
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:54,959
(Si Xiao Zhen)

408
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:57,319
(WeChat)

409
00:28:57,320 --> 00:28:58,720
(Fu Ming Yu)

410
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:00,840
I've landed.

411
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:02,360
How's the weather there?

412
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:09,240
(Fu Ming Yu, Recall Message)

413
00:29:10,840 --> 00:29:11,840
I must be crazy.

414
00:29:12,440 --> 00:29:13,520
Why did I message him?

415
00:29:51,480 --> 00:29:54,000
Hello. The number you have dialed is powered off.

416
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:56,360
- Sorry, the number... - Why is her phone off?

417
00:30:01,080 --> 00:30:02,080
Hello, Ruan Ruan.

418
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,400
Hello, Xuan.

419
00:30:03,560 --> 00:30:04,560
I've landed,

420
00:30:04,720 --> 00:30:06,240
but I can't reach Xiao Zhen.

421
00:30:06,840 --> 00:30:08,759
What time did she leave the bar?

422
00:30:08,760 --> 00:30:10,400
She left the bar quite a while ago.

423
00:30:10,800 --> 00:30:11,919
She said she would go to Lu Ming's first,

424
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,640
and then pick you up at the airport.

425
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:15,000
Hasn't she arrived yet?

426
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:16,160
No.

427
00:30:16,161 --> 00:30:17,360
Her phone is turned off.

428
00:30:18,760 --> 00:30:20,160
I hope nothing happened to her.

429
00:30:20,400 --> 00:30:21,760
I've been waiting here for ages.

430
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,000
Listen, don't panic.

431
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:24,559
I remember Lu Ming's address...

432
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:25,760
is in our group chat.

433
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:28,320
- I'll head over there now. - Okay, I'll head there too.

434
00:30:28,760 --> 00:30:29,760
Let's meet there.

435
00:30:38,040 --> 00:30:39,040
Ms. Ruan?

436
00:30:39,320 --> 00:30:40,760
What... What are you doing?

437
00:30:40,840 --> 00:30:42,440
Ms. Ruan, this is the taxi I hailed.

438
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:43,840
Where's your friend?

439
00:30:44,040 --> 00:30:45,200
My friend might be in danger.

440
00:30:45,280 --> 00:30:46,400
I'll pay for the whole fare.

441
00:30:46,720 --> 00:30:47,720
Let's go. Get in.

442
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:51,400
Get in, quick!

443
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:52,440
Wait.

444
00:30:53,520 --> 00:30:55,320
Driver, go to Ruifeng Garden Estate first.

445
00:30:59,040 --> 00:31:01,200
Ms. Ruan, how could you do this?

446
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:02,920
I waited so long for this car.

447
00:31:03,080 --> 00:31:04,080
Shut up.

448
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:06,960
I can't get a hold of Xiao Zhen.

449
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:10,160
Driver, please hurry.

450
00:31:21,520 --> 00:31:22,520
Xiao Zhen!

451
00:31:23,960 --> 00:31:25,599
It's the middle of the night. What are you doing sitting here?

452
00:31:25,600 --> 00:31:26,600
Where's Lu Ming?

453
00:31:26,601 --> 00:31:27,799
I've been waiting and waiting.

454
00:31:27,800 --> 00:31:29,720
I don't know where he went.

455
00:31:30,360 --> 00:31:32,200
He's not here.

456
00:31:32,800 --> 00:31:33,839
Don't cry now.

457
00:31:33,840 --> 00:31:35,080
Crying won't help.

458
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:37,600
- Xiao Zhen, where's Lu Ming? - It's okay.

459
00:31:38,280 --> 00:31:39,400
Ruan Ruan.

460
00:31:40,800 --> 00:31:41,800
There, there. It's okay.

461
00:31:41,801 --> 00:31:44,200
- Don't cry. - I can't find Lu Ming.

462
00:31:51,120 --> 00:31:52,560
Here. Drink it while it's hot.

463
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,720
Me too?

464
00:32:00,721 --> 00:32:02,080
Weren't you in the rain too?

465
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,680
Thank you.

466
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:07,440
Ruan Ruan, don't give her any.

467
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:08,640
For the sake of a man,

468
00:32:08,800 --> 00:32:10,040
she ditched you at the airport.

469
00:32:10,520 --> 00:32:11,720
I really didn't see it coming.

470
00:32:12,360 --> 00:32:14,056
This little thing puts romance before friendship.

471
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:15,760
I'm not a "little thing".

472
00:32:16,000 --> 00:32:17,080
You're right, you're not.

473
00:32:17,640 --> 00:32:18,720
You're a big jerk.

474
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:21,520
- How could you leave Ruan... - Xuan.

475
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:26,840
Ruan Ruan.

476
00:32:27,480 --> 00:32:30,480
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to leave you at the airport.

477
00:32:31,040 --> 00:32:32,720
I just didn't know what to do.

478
00:32:32,840 --> 00:32:34,520
I just wanted to ask him in person.

479
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:37,120
Why did he ignore me once he left for his trip?

480
00:32:37,480 --> 00:32:39,160
He didn't reply to texts or pick up calls.

481
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:42,000
Why hasn't he contacted me for so long?

482
00:32:42,880 --> 00:32:45,159
And my phone ran out of battery.

483
00:32:45,160 --> 00:32:46,760
I just lost my mind for a moment.

484
00:32:47,040 --> 00:32:48,519
I'm not someone who puts romance before friendship.

485
00:32:48,520 --> 00:32:49,520
Okay.

486
00:32:49,920 --> 00:32:51,920
I know you're not that kind of person.

487
00:32:51,960 --> 00:32:52,960
Si Xiao Zhen,

488
00:32:52,961 --> 00:32:54,320
is it worth it for a scumbag?

489
00:32:54,840 --> 00:32:56,600
"Going on a trip" or "business trip"...

490
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:58,719
are just the precursors to ghosting you.

491
00:32:58,720 --> 00:32:59,840
Once a man is away,

492
00:32:59,880 --> 00:33:00,880
his heart starts to wander.

493
00:33:00,881 --> 00:33:02,120
Then he can use the excuse...

494
00:33:02,320 --> 00:33:03,320
that he's very busy.

495
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,679
He doesn't care about your feelings at all.

496
00:33:05,680 --> 00:33:07,079
He... He's not like that!

497
00:33:07,080 --> 00:33:08,279
- He always told me... - It's sweet talk.

498
00:33:08,280 --> 00:33:09,920
Would he say anything mean to you?

499
00:33:11,760 --> 00:33:13,040
Tong Le, come here.

500
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:19,000
Say a few phrases...

501
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:21,320
that you use to sweet-talk women.

502
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,440
Before I met you,

503
00:33:34,441 --> 00:33:36,080
my life didn't really have a plan.

504
00:33:36,520 --> 00:33:37,520
But now it does.

505
00:33:37,960 --> 00:33:38,960
I have unilaterally...

506
00:33:38,961 --> 00:33:40,640
included you in my future.

507
00:33:41,040 --> 00:33:42,880
I'm not exactly a gentle person.

508
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:44,160
But for you,

509
00:33:44,360 --> 00:33:45,520
I can do gentle things.

510
00:33:46,080 --> 00:33:47,640
I didn't know how to mix drinks at all.

511
00:33:47,840 --> 00:33:48,960
But to stay here,

512
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:50,720
I did my absolute best to learn how.

513
00:33:51,280 --> 00:33:54,159
So whether you think I'm just driven by lust...

514
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:56,079
or completely infatuated, it doesn't matter.

515
00:33:56,080 --> 00:33:57,440
Anyway, I just want to tell you...

516
00:33:57,640 --> 00:33:59,279
that for you, I can change everything about myself.

517
00:33:59,280 --> 00:34:00,640
- All right, that's enough. - I...

518
00:34:02,520 --> 00:34:05,160
See? To coax a woman, men will lie through their teeth.

519
00:34:05,640 --> 00:34:06,760
Everything I said is true.

520
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:07,800
Are you done yet?

521
00:34:08,280 --> 00:34:10,096
Finished washing the glasses? Get back to work.

522
00:34:10,120 --> 00:34:11,120
You got it.

523
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:15,120
Men will say just about anything...

524
00:34:15,920 --> 00:34:17,080
to get what they want.

525
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:18,559
One second,

526
00:34:18,560 --> 00:34:19,759
they're all over you.

527
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:21,440
The next, they give you the cold shoulder.

528
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:22,800
They don't hesitate for a second.

529
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:24,000
If you ask them...

530
00:34:24,001 --> 00:34:25,361
why they don't value your history,

531
00:34:25,560 --> 00:34:26,960
they'll say there is no history...

532
00:34:27,200 --> 00:34:29,040
and that you just made it all up.

533
00:34:30,240 --> 00:34:31,240
Fine.

534
00:34:32,200 --> 00:34:33,360
Let's look at it another way.

535
00:34:33,560 --> 00:34:34,560
Did you and Lu Ming...

536
00:34:35,040 --> 00:34:36,120
ever make it official?

537
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:37,960
Did he ever confess to you?

538
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:43,120
Cutting off contact is how adults maintain a final bit of dignity.

539
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:45,280
You're so silly. You even went to his door.

540
00:34:46,120 --> 00:34:47,480
You made such a mess of yourself.

541
00:34:51,520 --> 00:34:52,520
You look...

542
00:34:54,200 --> 00:34:55,200
really beautiful today.

543
00:34:56,160 --> 00:34:57,400
I'm going to the US today.

544
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:58,880
I'll be back in 10 days.

545
00:35:00,520 --> 00:35:01,520
What a scumbag.

546
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:02,680
He's as lousy as a QR code.

547
00:35:03,840 --> 00:35:05,839
Back then, didn't Ruan Ruan and I tell you...

548
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:06,880
that he was unreliable?

549
00:35:07,200 --> 00:35:08,319
Didn't we both tell you...

550
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:09,560
to play it cool?

551
00:35:09,920 --> 00:35:11,080
But you didn't listen at all.

552
00:35:12,080 --> 00:35:13,360
The tears you're shedding now...

553
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:15,800
are the result of your earlier blindness.

554
00:35:16,400 --> 00:35:17,720
Let them flow. It's for the best.

555
00:35:17,880 --> 00:35:19,880
Tell me, is it because...

556
00:35:20,160 --> 00:35:22,640
I made him invest too much time?

557
00:35:23,080 --> 00:35:24,640
And since I never made my stance clear,

558
00:35:24,720 --> 00:35:26,200
has he lost his patience?

559
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:28,920
After everything I just said, you're actually blaming yourself?

560
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:31,720
Seducing and then dumping someone is a classic scumbag tactic.

561
00:35:32,120 --> 00:35:33,640
He's already moved on to the next one,

562
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:35,600
yet you're still finding fault with yourself.

563
00:35:44,520 --> 00:35:45,640
That's enough, Xiao Zhen.

564
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:47,760
No matter the reason,

565
00:35:48,080 --> 00:35:49,400
you have to face reality.

566
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,520
Usually, there are three possibilities...

567
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:54,760
for this kind of sudden disappearance.

568
00:35:55,080 --> 00:35:56,080
First,

569
00:35:56,160 --> 00:35:57,440
he has found a new target.

570
00:35:57,720 --> 00:35:58,720
Second,

571
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:01,360
his actual girlfriend found out.

572
00:36:01,480 --> 00:36:02,719
And there's one more possibility.

573
00:36:02,720 --> 00:36:04,600
He has been detained by the police.

574
00:36:04,960 --> 00:36:06,440
So which one is he?

575
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:08,200
Whichever it is,

576
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:11,600
you have to act as if this person never existed.

577
00:36:14,440 --> 00:36:15,840
All right, don't be sad anymore.

578
00:36:16,040 --> 00:36:17,040
After this drink,

579
00:36:17,680 --> 00:36:18,880
forget that scumbag.

580
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:20,440
When one relationship ends,

581
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:21,600
the next one will be better.

582
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:32,960
You're so kind.

583
00:36:34,040 --> 00:36:35,040
Are you still cold?

584
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:36,360
Not anymore.

585
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:43,919
(United States)

586
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:46,080
What's with Charles?

587
00:36:46,560 --> 00:36:47,560
He's just leaving us hanging here.

588
00:36:47,561 --> 00:36:49,360
It's so rude of him. He's late.

589
00:36:50,080 --> 00:36:52,480
We didn't reach out to him in the name of the company.

590
00:36:54,200 --> 00:36:55,640
He knows my purpose for coming here.

591
00:36:56,200 --> 00:36:57,736
It's normal for him to act high and mighty.

592
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:58,959
If I had known this would happen, we wouldn't have come here...

593
00:36:58,960 --> 00:37:00,359
straight from the airport.

594
00:37:00,360 --> 00:37:01,760
You haven't eaten anything all day.

595
00:37:02,040 --> 00:37:03,440
We could've eaten before coming.

596
00:37:03,560 --> 00:37:05,240
There's no need to wait for him like this.

597
00:37:06,080 --> 00:37:07,080
Let's wait a bit longer.

598
00:37:07,560 --> 00:37:08,680
If we hadn't come early,

599
00:37:09,120 --> 00:37:10,320
we might have missed him.

600
00:37:10,680 --> 00:37:11,680
But even if he shows up,

601
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:13,120
your jet lag is kicking in.

602
00:37:14,040 --> 00:37:15,120
How can you hold up?

603
00:37:15,640 --> 00:37:16,640
I was thinking...

604
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:18,240
of taking you to Chinatown.

605
00:37:18,600 --> 00:37:20,040
There's a great hot pot place there.

606
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:22,160
The one with the little stools.

607
00:37:22,600 --> 00:37:23,760
They have a mala hot pot.

608
00:37:24,280 --> 00:37:26,599
Many local Chinese people go there to check it out.

609
00:37:26,600 --> 00:37:28,600
- It's really delicious. - I don't eat spicy food.

610
00:37:45,160 --> 00:37:46,680
How did these two get so drunk?

611
00:37:47,760 --> 00:37:48,760
Tong Le,

612
00:37:49,120 --> 00:37:50,599
what did you put in this ginger tea?

613
00:37:50,600 --> 00:37:51,839
Red wine.

614
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:53,720
Red wine? Which bottle?

615
00:37:54,800 --> 00:37:55,800
The one...

616
00:37:56,160 --> 00:37:57,640
under your cabinet.

617
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,879
I saw it had been open for a while and wasn't finished yet.

618
00:37:59,880 --> 00:38:01,160
I didn't want it to go to waste.

619
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:02,880
Oh no.

620
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:04,520
The Romanée-Conti.

621
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,320
Now it just tastes like ginger.

622
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:26,400
What a total waste of a fine wine.

623
00:38:31,720 --> 00:38:32,720
Let's go.

624
00:38:33,040 --> 00:38:34,040
- Careful. - Careful.

625
00:38:34,840 --> 00:38:36,039
- Where's the light switch? - Light switch?

626
00:38:36,040 --> 00:38:37,520
The light switch is on your left.

627
00:38:38,160 --> 00:38:39,160
Close the door!

628
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:40,960
You forgot the suitcase.

629
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:43,759
Wait, change your shoes. Change them!

630
00:38:43,760 --> 00:38:45,159
Man, change my shoes?

631
00:38:45,160 --> 00:38:46,160
I can barely hold her up!
Put her on the bed first.

632
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:49,960
Careful.

633
00:38:51,200 --> 00:38:52,200
Oh, my gosh.

634
00:38:52,480 --> 00:38:53,799
- Easy. - Give me a hand.

635
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:54,800
Careful.

636
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:58,079
All right. Wait outside.

637
00:38:58,080 --> 00:38:59,320
I'll change her clothes first.

638
00:39:00,160 --> 00:39:01,600
Then I'll... I'll go get some water.

639
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:20,320
Tong Le,

640
00:39:21,040 --> 00:39:22,600
from now on, when those two come,

641
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:24,880
don't give them a single drop of alcohol.

642
00:39:26,680 --> 00:39:27,800
Unless someone is with them.

643
00:39:30,880 --> 00:39:31,880
You...

644
00:39:59,440 --> 00:40:00,440
What did you say?

645
00:40:01,400 --> 00:40:02,480
I said,

646
00:40:03,200 --> 00:40:05,760
they need someone to accompany them if they're drinking.

647
00:40:14,600 --> 00:40:15,920
Who do you want to accompany you?

648
00:40:17,520 --> 00:40:18,520
How about me?

649
00:40:54,960 --> 00:40:57,120
Is there no internet over there?

650
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,480
You won't even send me a text.

651
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:04,239
(Fu Ming Yu)

652
00:41:04,240 --> 00:41:06,256
(Waiting for the other person to accept the invitation)

653
00:41:06,280 --> 00:41:07,519
- Thank you. - Thank you very much.

654
00:41:07,520 --> 00:41:08,759
- Nice to meet you guys. - Nice to meet you too.

655
00:41:08,760 --> 00:41:09,799
- Have a great trip home. - See you.

656
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:10,879
- See you. - See you.

657
00:41:10,880 --> 00:41:11,960
- Bye, guys. - See you.

658
00:41:13,600 --> 00:41:15,039
We have that meeting, right?

659
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:16,400
- In the afternoon. - Okay.

660
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,920
Hello?

661
00:41:25,520 --> 00:41:27,200
Are you Fu Ming Yu?

662
00:41:28,280 --> 00:41:30,960
- It's me. - So you didn't lose your phone.

663
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:34,400
And your phone isn't broken either.

664
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:37,520
You pretend to be busy as soon as you're on a trip.

665
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:40,400
And then you stop texting.

666
00:41:40,720 --> 00:41:42,480
You're just a player who abandons people.

667
00:41:43,560 --> 00:41:45,600
You got what you wanted and left.

668
00:41:49,720 --> 00:41:50,720
Have you been drinking?
No!

669
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:54,680
I'm perfectly sober right now.

670
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:58,280
I'm going to make a major decision.

671
00:41:59,720 --> 00:42:01,400
I'm going to kick you out.

672
00:42:02,560 --> 00:42:04,400
Kick you out of my head.

673
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:06,960
I won't think about you anymore.

674
00:42:07,960 --> 00:42:09,040
Scumbag.

675
00:42:10,080 --> 00:42:11,080
Do you think...

676
00:42:11,081 --> 00:42:12,519
that just because you celebrated my birthday,

677
00:42:12,520 --> 00:42:13,720
you've earned a title?

678
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:15,520
Not even close.

679
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:17,480
I'm going to lock my heart away.

680
00:42:18,520 --> 00:42:20,640
I'll be invulnerable.

681
00:42:22,280 --> 00:42:23,920
I'll listen to Xuan.

682
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:26,400
I won't believe men's lies.

683
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:28,800
I won't believe you.

684
00:42:29,200 --> 00:42:30,200
Scumbag.

685
00:42:42,840 --> 00:42:43,840
Mr. Fu.

686
00:42:44,040 --> 00:42:46,336
The itinerary for this trip needs to be compressed further.

687
00:42:46,360 --> 00:42:47,400
I need to head back early.

688
00:42:48,080 --> 00:42:49,360
Are we not going to eat hot pot?

689
00:43:50,000 --> 00:43:55,000
(Departing Ep. 12 for Ep. 13)
